                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR SCHNELLEN UMSCHALTUNG ZWISCHEN EINZEL-DCI- UND MEHRFACH-DCI-MODUS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ DE COMMUTATION RAPIDE DE MODE DCI UNIQUE ET DE MODE DCI MULTIPLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR FAST SINGLE-DCI AND MULTI-DCI MODE SWITCHING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments are presented herein of apparatuses, systems, and methods for a user equipment device (UE) and/or cellular network to perform downlink control information (DCI) mode signaling and control resource set (CORESET) selection. A DCI mode may be signaled based on a predefined rule, media access control (MAC) control element (CE), and/or group based beam reporting. One or more CORESETs may be selected based on configuration of an active bandwidth part (BWP), CORESET identifier, higher layer index, periodicity, type of search space, and/or MAC CE.</p>
            </abstract>
